function previewPersonaButtons(){return [['visitor','Student · public events'],['student','President'],['vice','Vice president'],['secretary','Secretary'],['treasurer','Treasurer'],['advisor','Advisor'],['sld','SLD staff']].map(([persona,label])=>`<button data-persona="${persona}"><img src="/web/avatars/${persona}.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32">${label}</button>`).join('');}
function safeImageUrl(value){if(typeof value!=='string')return '';if(/^data:image\/(png|jpeg|webp);base64,[A-Za-z0-9+/=]+$/.test(value)||/^\/web\/avatars\/[a-z]+\.svg$/.test(value))return value;try{const url=new URL(value);if(url.protocol==='https:'&&(url.hostname==='lh3.googleusercontent.com'||url.hostname.endsWith('.googleusercontent.com')))return url.href;}catch{}return '';}
